1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,200
My goal is to return humanity to its primitive
state.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:08,500
Rasetsu, to carry out my plan,

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,300
dispatch our troops to nations across the world!

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,750
Yes, Lord Lando!

5
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,100
Here are your orders!

6
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,650
General Bat, to Germany!

7
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:19,850
Yes, sir!

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,950
Gore, to Russia!

9
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:23,500
As you command!

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,050
Burai, you will go to Britain.

11
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,050
Can you no longer hear me?

12
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:33,850
This is what comes of resisting the brainwashing.

13
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,150
No matter.

14
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:37,650
All forces, move out!
